  <section|Inputs and notation><label|inputs-and-notation>

  \<langle\>State exact prerequisite interfaces and their status; link
  canonical units, shared glossary, notation contract and literature notes.
  Identify outstanding inputs. Do not copy the mathematical proof from
  LaTeX.\<rangle\>

  <block|<tformat|<twith|table-width|1par>|<twith|table-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|bottom>|<table|<row|<cell|<strong|Symbol>>|<cell|<strong|Meaning,
  space and normalisation>>|<cell|<strong|Origin>>|<cell|<strong|Local
  conversion>>>|<row|<cell|\<langle\>symbol\<rangle\>>|<cell|\<langle\>meaning\<rangle\>>|<cell|\<langle\>glossary
  or source\<rangle\>>|<cell|\<langle\>conversion, or none\<rangle\>>>>>>

  <section|Correspondence><label|correspondence>

  <block|<tformat|<twith|table-width|1par>|<twith|table-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|bottom>|<table|<row|<cell|<strong|Manuscript
  label or step>>|<cell|<strong|Fully qualified
  declaration>>|<cell|<strong|Pinned source
  path>>>|<row|<cell|\<langle\>label/step\<rangle\>>|<cell|\<langle\>name\<rangle\>>|<cell|\<langle\>path\<rangle\>>>>>>

  <section|Literature and editorial decisions><label|literature-and-editorial-decisions>

  \<langle\>Record the sources actually read and hypotheses checked, any
  unmatched variants, and justified grouping of formal helpers. Keep the
  conventional citations in LaTeX.\<rangle\>

  <section|Open obligations and evidence><label|open-obligations-and-evidence>

  \<langle\>List unresolved interpretations and proof obligations, commands
  actually run, results and unrun checks. Link longer evidence. Reviews
  remain independent.\<rangle\>
